1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Autonomous AI coding agents can write entire features in minutes,

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
but running them in production without strict tool sandboxing is an engineering disaster.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Empirical benchmarks show frontier models fail on over ninety-five percent of software tasks

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,000
without structured execution sandboxes and verified feedback loops.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,000
When agents execute raw bash commands without boundaries,

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,000
unconstrained multi-step runs easily diverge or corrupt local workspace state.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The solution is deterministic runtime governance.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Tools must execute inside isolated sandboxes with strict schema contracts.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Shadow dry-runs prove zero mutations and zero unverified uploads

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:12,000
before any byte reaches production. Deploy with total confidence.
